### 11.3 Get My Profile After Update
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 11.4 Try Updating Email
# This should fail because email changes are not allowed
# through the profile API
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "newemail@example.com"
}

###

### 11.5 Try Updating Password
# This should fail because password changes must use
# the existing /auth/change-password API
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "NewPassword@123"
}

