Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ADMINISTRATOR - DASHBOARD
GET http://localhost:5000/api/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

######################################My Applications APIs############################
### 1. Get all applications assigned to the logged-in L0 Screener
